  "semantics": [
    "5C03 reads one signed unit WORD and calls dmKillChar.5C07 reads two WORDs, ignores the second, calls dmKillChar2.",
    "dmKillChar clears active and occupancy only if80 is not set. dmKillChar2 sets80 without altering HP/ghost/XP.",
    "40 numeric flag gates death updates/render. Normal death increments164, plays sound1 on first step, clears100/enabled after18. Job/100==7 retires immediately without death sound.",
    "Corpse rows32 for counter<8, then counter%4. Spark is31x31 at floor(counter/3)*32. This is a client display/lifecycle rule, not ghost/revival/respawn policy."
